OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised over two-day
OL,4,Amarathon impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and residents in south-east
OL,7,FLondon are seeking assurances over
OL,8,Fdisruption caused by the planned
OL,9,Fexpansion of the London Marathon to two
OL,10,Fdays in 2027.
OL,12,FRoad closures and parking restrictions
OL,13,Fwill be in place during the marathon on
OL,14,F24 and 25 April.
OL,16,FLord Dunvall, London Assembly member
OL,17,Ffor Greenwich and Lewisham, described
OL,18,Fthe event as "an exciting opportunity,
OL,19,Fbut it is important that we get the
OL,20,Fdetails right" and said "people need
OL,21,Fclear and early information about how
OL,22,Fthey will be affected".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
