OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised over two-day
OL,4,Amarathon impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FHugh Brasher, chief executive of London
OL,7,FMarathon Events, said organisers were
OL,8,F"working closely with boroughs along
OL,9,Fthe route to minimise disruption for
OL,10,Fresidents, businesses and local
OL,11,Fcommunities".
